d  so he met us on a popular street corner  and and guided us to how to find his  apartment so it's a smooth  entrance right so we know how to get  there it's a good feeling right from the  start he toured us around his place he  showed us how all the different gadgets  and gizmos worked he had this machine  that helped purify the air and he had  this japanese toilet seat that did all  sorts of  crazy stuff the fun to experiment with  anyway we won't get into that but he  showed us around he showed us how  everything worked and made sure if we  had any questions he was there let him  know you know here's here's his phone  number  and it was just a great  welcoming to the city  we opened up the fridge and he had some  egg rolls in there for us he had some  candies in there for us if we got  snack-ish we could we could peck on it  and then he started telling us  recommendations for where to have  breakfast and where to have dinner and  where to have lunch and things to see  when it was a heavily polluted day he he  wrote to us and said hey if you're going  outside today make sure you go out and  buy the masks and for us like i'd never  worn a mask out in public and you know  he said okay go to go to this store  make sure you buy this grade of mass  because there's all kinds and and and we  did and we paid attention to it because  it was it was really really bad  pollution  and when we were leaving he said you  know i'm going to meet you again uh  let's meet at the at the condo at this  time and he met us and he thanked us and  he asked how everything was he hailed a  cab for us and told the driver where to  go and so  you know  the dude just went way over and above  what was expected we got way more than  just a room that's what i expected right  a clean room and and he helped make our  vacation  special and so that's what you need to  do as an entrepreneur right you don't  just offer the bare basics  because that's boring because it doesn't  inspire referrals it doesn't inspire  repeat business if i'm going back to  beijing i'm going to go see jason and  use his place if my friends are going to  beijing i'm going to say hey you have to  go stay with jason he's the best guy to  stay with and so  you got to do that guys you gotta go way  above and beyond and over deliver like  crazy to get repeat business and get  more froze so  anyway jason  thank you so much you helped make our  trip special really from the bottom of  our hearts uh  i can't thank you enough for  for how awesome you were man it really  helped make our trip i appreciate it um  and for those of you watching  take time today to thank somebody who  has helped you in your business in your  life you know you can't do this alone  take five minutes  you can make a video you can write an  email you can write a handwritten note  and it doesn't have to cost you anything  just a couple minutes of your day to  show some appreciation to show some  gratitude and say  thank you  believe  for those who watching you like the  video you want to see more just like  this you can subscribe to the channel  thank you so much i'll see you soon  you
 

